<title>USA: Chubb Corp names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Chubb Corp names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubb Corp said Thursday that David Kelso has been named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Percy Chubb, who is to remain as vice chairman until his retirement on February 1, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Kelso has been the executive vice president of Chubb since July.</p>
<p>Chubb Corp is a holding company with subsidiaries engaged in property and casualty insurance, life insurance and real estate.</p>
